    },
    "body": "This doesn't fix the general case of rebroadcasting potentially surprising users by divulging the originator IP trivially, but for users opting into private broadcast, it seems a bridge too far for them to expect the current behavior.\r\n\r\ne.g. an incoming dust payment triggering your node to rebroadcast 24-36th later over clearnet\r\n\r\nThis can be removed if/when wallet drives through private broadcast.\r\n\r\nsee https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/3828 for running broader issue",
